{"id":"conosco","lemma":"conosco","pos":"adv","rank":492,"glosses":["with us"],"ipa":"/koˈnos.ku/","examples":[{"text":"Quem virá conosco?","en":"Who will come with us?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274268","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},null]},{"text":"Tom está conosco?","en":"Is Tom with us?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/491178","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Você quer ir conosco?","en":"Do you want to go with us?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to go"},null]},{"text":"Tom quer vir conosco.","en":"Tom wants to come with us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/963436","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to come"},null]},{"text":"Isso nunca aconteceu conosco antes.","en":"That's never happened to us before.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to happen","l":"acontecer"},null,{"g":"before"}]}]}